"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-liang-yang","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line020","quote":"咸甯初，以扶風池陽四千一百戶為太妃伏氏湯沐邑，置家令丞僕，後改食南郡枝江。太妃嘗有小疾，祓于洛水，亮兄弟三人侍從，並持節鼓吹，震耀洛濱。武帝登陵雲臺望見，曰：「伏妃可謂富貴矣。」其年進號衛將軍，加侍中。時宗室殷盛，無相統攝，乃以亮為宗師，本官如故，使訓導觀察，有不遵禮法，小者正以義方，大者隨事聞奏。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line020:m0015"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-phase4-j-066:a001","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line020","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"太妃","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line020:m0015","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"來源限定用稱或任授；不把未載紀年補成單年，不以死亡結束全部職爵。兼領與職掌按原詞保留。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[{"id":"pa-phase4-j-010","person_id":"q6k_jro_wvy","relation":"fief","place":{"source_name":"扶風池陽","place_id":null,"modern_identification":null},"status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"source_term":"以扶風池陽四千一百戶為太妃伏氏湯沐邑","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-059","source_id":"s-jinshu-059-liang-yang","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line020","quote":"咸甯初，以扶風池陽四千一百戶為太妃伏氏湯沐邑，置家令丞僕，後改食南郡枝江。太妃嘗有小疾，祓于洛水，亮兄弟三人侍從，並持節鼓吹，震耀洛濱。武帝登陵雲臺望見，曰：「伏妃可謂富貴矣。」其年進號衛將軍，加侍中。時宗室殷盛，無相統攝，乃以亮為宗師，本官如故，使訓導觀察，有不遵禮法，小者正以義方，大者隨事聞奏。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-059-liang-yang:line020:m0015"}],"interpretation_note":"原地名照錄；官地、遷行地及食邑分開，不當出生地或籍貫，不補現代座標。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"qualifiers":{"fief_kind":"tangmu_estate"}}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-jinshu059-伏氏","person_id":"q6k_jro_wvy","surfaces":["伏妃","太妃","太妃伏氏"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-jinsh